WEBVTT

01:30.520 --> 01:34.940
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.210 --> 01:37.759
[Episode 1]

01:38.400 --> 01:39.920
[Since the beginning of time,]

01:39.920 --> 01:41.840
[legends have told of
a celestial mountain]

01:41.840 --> 01:44.150
[with a spring called Yuli.]

01:45.000 --> 01:47.259
[Humans who drink it gain immortality,]

01:47.560 --> 01:50.289
[while demons
gain 1,000 years of cultivation.]

01:50.590 --> 01:53.590
[However,
this mountain drifts between sea and sky.]

01:53.710 --> 01:56.000
[Only with the guidance
of the ancient Kunlun Mirror]

01:56.000 --> 01:57.870
[can one be led there.]

01:58.229 --> 02:00.710
[Humans and demons alike
have been trying to find it]

02:00.710 --> 02:01.870
[relentlessly.]

02:02.400 --> 02:05.680
[Among them, the emperors of the
Tiancheng Kingdom were the most obsessed,]

02:05.680 --> 02:08.960
[even sending seven costly expeditions.]

02:22.520 --> 02:24.120
The celestial mountain?

02:22.790 --> 02:24.810
[Emperor of Tiansheng Kingdom]

02:43.920 --> 02:45.790
The divine has blessed me.

02:46.480 --> 02:49.329
This must be Yuli Spring.

02:57.030 --> 02:59.420
[Dreamshard Immortal]

03:00.960 --> 03:02.690
Greetings, Exalted Immortal.

03:02.880 --> 03:06.020
Thank you for granting me Yuli.

03:06.950 --> 03:08.200
What you see

03:08.780 --> 03:10.190
is merely an illusion.

03:10.960 --> 03:12.800
To find the true Yuli Spring,

03:14.360 --> 03:16.780
you need the guidance of the Kunlun Mirror

03:17.320 --> 03:20.150
to find the path
to the celestial mountain.

03:20.800 --> 03:23.060
Please enlighten me, Exalted Immortal.

03:24.820 --> 03:26.820
You're the Emperor, who is supreme.

03:27.060 --> 03:28.680
Others are of no concern,

03:29.590 --> 03:32.030
except Hong Ye, the Monarch of All Demons.

03:32.470 --> 03:33.840
But Hong Ye was

03:33.840 --> 03:36.840
destroyed by our ancestors 100 years ago.

03:37.070 --> 03:38.579
He is merely lying dormant.

03:38.579 --> 03:40.860
If he drinks from Yuli Spring first

03:41.730 --> 03:43.060
and regains his powers,

03:43.829 --> 03:44.920
in this world,

03:45.310 --> 03:47.579
no one will be able to match him.

03:48.680 --> 03:50.020
Remember this face.

03:50.950 --> 03:53.810
[Hong Ye]

04:07.320 --> 04:08.920
If you want to live forever,

04:10.000 --> 04:11.910
you must step over my dead body!

04:19.720 --> 04:20.800
Yuli Spring...

04:22.240 --> 04:23.510
Your Majesty,

04:24.120 --> 04:25.430
what's wrong?

04:26.400 --> 04:30.070
His Majesty
was tormented by nightmares at night,

04:30.560 --> 04:33.409
and the Feiyu Guard failed to protect him.

04:33.510 --> 04:36.740
All Feiyu Guards,
assemble outside the side hall

04:36.950 --> 04:38.720
for punishment

04:40.310 --> 04:43.750
The late emperor
established the Feiyu Guard

04:44.510 --> 04:46.550
to eliminate demons in the capital.

04:47.560 --> 04:48.830
And now,

04:50.070 --> 04:51.800
in your time,

04:52.750 --> 04:55.130
demons have invaded my bedchamber!

04:56.360 --> 04:58.159
Your Majesty, please calm your anger!

04:58.159 --> 05:00.600
I deserve death!

05:01.830 --> 05:04.100
Should I keep the Feiyu Guard,

05:04.430 --> 05:07.000
or should I keep you as the Demon Slayer?

05:10.040 --> 05:10.930
Your Majesty!

05:11.310 --> 05:12.110
Your Majesty!

05:12.510 --> 05:13.430
Your Majesty!

05:14.040 --> 05:16.180
Please forgive me, Your Majesty!

05:16.390 --> 05:18.390
Please spare my life, Your Majesty!

05:24.720 --> 05:26.190
Which one is Bingzhu?

05:29.630 --> 05:30.360
I am...

05:31.430 --> 05:32.190
Bingzhu.

05:32.140 --> 05:33.800
[Bingzhu]

05:36.000 --> 05:37.310
From today onward,

05:38.920 --> 05:42.750
you will take over as the Demon Slayer
of the Feiyu Guard.

05:46.310 --> 05:49.360
With this token,
you can command all provinces

05:46.730 --> 05:49.280
[Demon Slayer of the Feiyu Guard]

05:49.390 --> 05:51.040
to assist the Feiyu Guard

05:52.630 --> 05:54.230
in eliminating evil demons.

05:54.950 --> 05:56.430
I-I, Bingzhu,

05:57.600 --> 05:58.659
obey your command.

06:02.360 --> 06:05.720
Bingzhu, Demon Slayer of the Feiyu Guards,

06:05.720 --> 06:08.320
enter the hall
to receive the imperial decree!

06:12.720 --> 06:13.580
Thank you, sir.

06:29.310 --> 06:31.270
It's 9PM!

06:31.600 --> 06:33.600
Lock your doors and windows,

06:34.750 --> 06:37.140
keep your family safe,

06:37.310 --> 06:38.430
and beware of demons!

06:38.430 --> 06:39.159
Mom,

06:39.159 --> 06:42.880
why can't we go outside after dark?

06:43.120 --> 06:44.360
Because when it gets dark,

06:44.360 --> 06:46.020
demons come out to eat people.

06:46.680 --> 06:47.409
Mom.

06:47.680 --> 06:48.870
The demons you talk about—

06:48.870 --> 06:50.720
do they look like this?

07:08.160 --> 07:09.950
Little rascal, go to sleep.

07:13.850 --> 07:15.870
Demon! Demon!

07:15.870 --> 07:17.610
Demon!

07:51.130 --> 07:53.710
[Xiao Yao]

07:55.240 --> 07:57.380
Keep your family safe!

08:01.480 --> 08:03.600
It's 9PM!

08:04.870 --> 08:07.160
Lock your doors and windows,

08:07.160 --> 08:09.480
keep your family safe,

08:09.480 --> 08:11.390
and beware of demons!

08:14.490 --> 08:15.610
Demon!

08:18.160 --> 08:18.600
Don't be afraid!

08:18.600 --> 08:20.730
I will surely capture that bear demon!

08:22.320 --> 08:23.510
A sorcerer is catching demons!

08:23.510 --> 08:25.630
Everyone, come and help catch the demon!

08:25.630 --> 08:26.270
Hurry!

08:27.000 --> 08:27.740
Where is it?

08:39.440 --> 08:39.900
My Lord,

08:40.440 --> 08:41.909
since the demon has appeared,

08:41.299 --> 08:44.300
[Ji Yan]

08:42.030 --> 08:43.480
should we use the Feiyu token

08:43.480 --> 08:45.080
to call for reinforcements?

08:45.960 --> 08:48.200
My demon-slaying blade hasn't alerted me.

08:48.200 --> 08:48.800
Why panic?

08:48.830 --> 08:49.550
Where is it?

08:49.670 --> 08:50.680
Where is it?

08:50.790 --> 08:51.600
Where's the demon?

08:51.600 --> 08:52.660
Where's the demon?

08:54.060 --> 08:55.240
Everyone, rest assured.

08:55.240 --> 08:56.320
Now that I've taken action,

08:56.320 --> 08:58.240
victory is certain. Follow me!

08:58.360 --> 08:58.670
Let's go!

08:58.670 --> 08:59.240
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

08:59.240 --> 09:00.170
Catch the demon!

09:01.360 --> 09:02.630
Hurry! This way!

09:02.630 --> 09:04.430
Don't let the bear demon escape!

09:04.670 --> 09:05.870
It's the curfew hour.

09:05.910 --> 09:06.840
Who's there?

09:08.390 --> 09:09.150
Officer,

09:09.270 --> 09:11.150
I am a demon hunter from Jiwei Mountain.

09:11.150 --> 09:12.650
I've been chasing a bear demon
all the way here.

09:12.650 --> 09:14.150
Please do me a favor

09:14.150 --> 09:15.410
and open the city gate.

09:15.840 --> 09:17.640
Closing the city gates at night
is the law.

09:16.770 --> 09:19.010
[Pingjiang Prefecture]

09:17.790 --> 09:19.190
No one may enter or leave.

09:19.240 --> 09:20.550
The bear demon is violent by nature

09:20.550 --> 09:21.720
and has hurt countless people.

09:21.720 --> 09:23.390
If it returns to Pingjiang Prefecture
to cause harm,

09:23.390 --> 09:25.320
what good will closing the gates do?

09:25.320 --> 09:26.220
That's right!

09:26.270 --> 09:28.240
The officials have their own judgment.

09:28.240 --> 09:28.960
Master,

09:29.240 --> 09:31.640
please don't make things difficult for us.

09:32.470 --> 09:33.150
Heroine,

09:33.440 --> 09:34.870
if you leave the city now,

09:34.870 --> 09:36.270
the demon will turn back,

09:36.270 --> 09:37.750
and the ones who suffer

09:37.750 --> 09:39.200
will be common folk like us.

09:39.200 --> 09:39.780
Yes, yes!

09:40.120 --> 09:41.570
Please stay, heroine!

09:43.030 --> 09:44.290
Please stay, heroine!

09:45.030 --> 09:46.530
-Stay!
-Stay!

09:47.320 --> 09:49.160
Protect us, heroine!

09:49.440 --> 09:50.450
Please stay!

09:51.750 --> 09:52.910
Stay, heroine!

09:53.000 --> 09:54.060
Make way! Make way!

09:54.080 --> 09:55.210
The Prefect is here!

09:55.840 --> 09:56.840
Set down the sedan.

09:56.840 --> 09:58.970
Set down the sedan! Set down the sedan!

10:02.480 --> 10:03.150
Master,

10:03.910 --> 10:07.200
I've prepared excellent food and wine
at my residence.

10:06.940 --> 10:09.940
[Prefect]

10:07.200 --> 10:10.030
Please stay at my house for a few days.

10:10.600 --> 10:11.360
Yes, yes.

10:11.360 --> 10:12.150
But...

10:14.440 --> 10:16.480
Master, may I have a word with you?

10:21.860 --> 10:22.720
Go!

10:22.790 --> 10:23.200
Go!

10:24.000 --> 10:25.280
To be honest with you, Master,

10:25.280 --> 10:26.240
I have two daughters

10:26.240 --> 10:27.570
at home.

10:28.000 --> 10:29.910
They've heard about
the recent demon attacks

10:29.910 --> 10:32.550
and haven't eaten
or slept properly for days.

10:32.630 --> 10:34.790
They're often distracted and anxious.

10:34.790 --> 10:37.080
I hope you can help us.

10:38.490 --> 10:40.060
I appreciate your kindness,

10:40.060 --> 10:42.020
but if I don't eliminate the bear demon,

10:42.020 --> 10:43.980
what if it returns to harm the people?

10:43.980 --> 10:45.830
What should we do if the bear demon
comes back?

10:45.830 --> 10:48.210
-Master! You can't leave!
-You can't leave us alone.

10:48.210 --> 10:49.940
Shut up! Shut up!

10:50.100 --> 10:51.900
Who are you to speak here?

10:53.440 --> 10:54.760
If you take the Master home,

10:54.760 --> 10:57.360
-who will protect us common folk?
-Stop making such a fuss!

10:57.360 --> 10:58.220
How about this?

10:59.320 --> 11:00.030
I have

11:00.200 --> 11:01.440
some talismans here.

11:01.910 --> 11:03.080
Place them on your doors and windows,

11:03.080 --> 11:05.000
and they will prevent demons
from approaching.

11:05.000 --> 11:06.270
You can also carry them with you.

11:06.270 --> 11:07.390
Recite the incantation,

11:07.390 --> 11:09.390
and it will keep demons at bay.

11:09.600 --> 11:10.390
Today,

11:10.630 --> 11:12.260
I'll give them to you.

11:12.450 --> 11:13.340
Master,

11:13.630 --> 11:16.720
I heard that others' talismans
are quite expensive.

11:16.870 --> 11:18.510
You're giving these away for free.

11:18.510 --> 11:20.720
Will they actually work?

11:21.240 --> 11:22.000
How rude!

11:23.320 --> 11:24.360
These were given to me

11:24.360 --> 11:26.690
by my master for protection before I left.

11:27.670 --> 11:29.330
Talk about ingratitude!

11:29.350 --> 11:30.360
So ungrateful.

11:30.360 --> 11:31.280
Forget it then.

11:32.360 --> 11:33.510
I'll take them all.

11:33.720 --> 11:35.120
Name your price, Master.

11:36.750 --> 11:37.990
I'll pay 5 coins!

11:38.080 --> 11:39.030
10 coins!

11:39.390 --> 11:40.340
I'll pay 60 coins!

11:40.340 --> 11:42.000
Why is he bidding up the price?

11:43.870 --> 11:45.760
I'll pay 1 tael!

11:46.030 --> 11:47.000
That's too much.

11:47.000 --> 11:48.130
I can't afford that.

11:48.550 --> 11:49.240
Everyone,

11:49.870 --> 11:51.120
since fate has brought us together today,

11:51.120 --> 11:53.320
I'll create a bond of goodwill with you.

11:54.550 --> 11:55.880
I'll sell this talisman

11:56.390 --> 11:58.530
for one coin a piece. Is that all right?

12:00.030 --> 12:01.570
No need to rush! Don't push!

12:01.960 --> 12:03.240
Pay the money and you'll get one!

12:03.240 --> 12:03.870
You just need to pay!

12:03.870 --> 12:04.960
Don't push!

12:06.060 --> 12:06.860
Stop pushing!

12:07.480 --> 12:09.390
There's enough for everyone!

12:13.550 --> 12:15.920
I've been hunting demons for years,

12:16.550 --> 12:18.550
but today I've truly opened my eyes.

12:19.960 --> 12:21.550
I didn't know you were here, sir.

12:21.550 --> 12:22.630
Forgive me for not greeting you properly.

12:22.630 --> 12:23.630
Please accept my apologies.

12:23.630 --> 12:25.160
Please step back, Prefect.

12:25.960 --> 12:27.520
I'd like to have

12:27.910 --> 12:29.640
a word with this female Master.

12:30.870 --> 12:31.670
I'm Bingzhu,

12:32.890 --> 12:34.910
[Demon Slayer of the Feiyu Guard]

12:33.120 --> 12:34.920
Demon Slayer of the Feiyu Guard.

12:38.610 --> 12:40.340
So you're Master Bingzhu.

12:40.440 --> 12:42.260
May I ask your name

12:42.870 --> 12:44.910
and which immortal sect you belong to?

12:44.910 --> 12:46.720
We focus on quiet cultivation.

12:46.720 --> 12:48.270
To avoid worldly distractions,

12:48.270 --> 12:49.630
I cannot disclose that information.

12:49.630 --> 12:50.870
Please understand.

13:00.080 --> 13:01.200
This seems to be fur

13:01.200 --> 13:03.060
that fell off that demon just now.

13:04.950 --> 13:06.120
It is bear fur,

13:11.000 --> 13:13.170
but since it hasn't been nourished
by blood,

13:13.170 --> 13:14.700
it has long since dried out.

13:15.390 --> 13:17.590
Perhaps it was scorched by my fire whip.

13:17.910 --> 13:18.910
That makes sense.

13:23.480 --> 13:24.690
But this footprint

13:25.240 --> 13:28.380
doesn't match the size of that bear demon.

13:28.670 --> 13:30.080
That bear demon

13:30.320 --> 13:31.620
was massive,

13:31.790 --> 13:34.050
weighing between 150 and 250 kilograms,

13:34.720 --> 13:36.080
but this footprint looks like...

13:36.080 --> 13:38.150
it's from something
barely over 50 kilograms—

13:38.150 --> 13:39.630
more like a human.

13:42.600 --> 13:43.380
Master,

13:43.630 --> 13:44.830
what's your opinion?

13:57.240 --> 13:58.150
Fifty-fifty?

14:02.000 --> 14:02.720
All of it.

14:04.320 --> 14:05.230
Forty-sixty?

14:05.250 --> 14:07.650
-You get sixty, and I get forty.
-I told you.

14:09.200 --> 14:10.030
All of it.

14:13.840 --> 14:16.030
The Feiyu Guard has been
watching over the city this whole time,

14:16.030 --> 14:18.510
and not a single fly has gotten out,

14:19.150 --> 14:20.550
which means the demon...

14:21.720 --> 14:23.120
is still inside the city.

14:27.030 --> 14:28.750
What exactly do you want?

14:34.270 --> 14:35.610
Feiyu Guards came here

14:35.840 --> 14:36.900
to catch the demon.

14:37.630 --> 14:39.120
But this female master

14:39.360 --> 14:40.720
accidentally let it escape.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.580
Fortunately, the Feiyu Guard...

14:44.750 --> 14:46.150
didn't fail its mission.

14:46.790 --> 14:47.120
Move!

14:47.200 --> 14:47.530
Move!

14:47.960 --> 14:48.960
Behave yourself!

14:51.440 --> 14:51.840
Move!

14:52.000 --> 14:52.390
Move!

14:53.270 --> 14:54.000
It's a human!

14:54.270 --> 14:54.750
It's a human!

14:54.750 --> 14:55.630
It's a human!

14:56.840 --> 14:57.670
It's a human!

14:57.730 --> 14:58.360
Daughter,

14:58.600 --> 15:00.000
[Xiao Dadan]

14:59.000 --> 15:00.130
we've been exposed!

15:00.150 --> 15:01.020
Frauds!

15:03.280 --> 15:05.240
I've had my eyes on you from the start.

15:05.240 --> 15:06.390
Still trying to run?

15:08.440 --> 15:14.200
Beware!

15:14.580 --> 15:17.640
[Justice of the World]

15:16.000 --> 15:18.720
Beware!

15:18.720 --> 15:19.700
Please, sir.

15:37.080 --> 15:37.910
Have a seat.

15:38.870 --> 15:39.510
Sit.

15:40.880 --> 15:45.900
[Righteousness]

15:43.720 --> 15:45.950
Swindler, state your names!

15:48.240 --> 15:49.440
Bring cold water here

15:49.630 --> 15:50.680
to wake her up.

15:51.240 --> 15:51.790
Cold water.

15:51.790 --> 15:52.320
Yes.

15:55.480 --> 15:56.960
Where am I?

15:59.000 --> 15:59.960
Officer?

16:02.570 --> 16:03.750
-Dad?
-Daughter.

16:04.600 --> 16:06.460
-You insolent criminal!
-You...

16:07.200 --> 16:09.080
You are extremely brazen.

16:10.270 --> 16:12.030
This is the magistrate's office,

16:12.030 --> 16:14.320
not a place for your theatrics!

16:15.670 --> 16:16.960
My name is Xiao Yao.

16:17.030 --> 16:19.140
This is my father, Xiao Dadan.

16:19.240 --> 16:21.170
Those people are from my hometown.

16:21.240 --> 16:22.870
We were originally hunters.

16:23.200 --> 16:24.600
But several months ago,

16:24.600 --> 16:27.320
the magistrate's office suddenly ordered
us to catch demons within a deadline.

16:27.320 --> 16:29.520
How do we know how to catch demons?

16:30.150 --> 16:31.080
We had no choice

16:31.080 --> 16:33.000
but to leave our hometown.

16:33.000 --> 16:35.390
Out of desperation,

16:35.390 --> 16:38.270
we risked our lives to hunt a bear

16:39.390 --> 16:40.410
and used its skin

16:40.410 --> 16:41.960
-to pretend to be a demon.
-Troublemakers.

16:41.960 --> 16:42.720
Menaces!

16:43.200 --> 16:46.600
So you're the ones
behind the demon disturbances in the city!

16:47.150 --> 16:48.610
You caused my daughter...

16:51.200 --> 16:53.910
You caused my daughter mental fatigue

16:54.030 --> 16:56.920
and the people of this city
are living in fear.

16:58.070 --> 16:58.770
Officer,

16:59.630 --> 17:00.870
I know I was wrong.

17:00.870 --> 17:02.840
But we have never harmed anyone.

17:03.000 --> 17:04.400
We're just asking for a chance to live.

17:04.400 --> 17:05.920
Please judge us fairly.

17:04.920 --> 17:11.780
[Righteousness]

17:05.920 --> 17:06.910
Judge?

17:07.550 --> 17:08.640
We caught you red-handed.

17:08.640 --> 17:09.200
Guards!

17:09.400 --> 17:10.440
Take this female swindler to prison

17:10.440 --> 17:11.750
to await execution!

17:12.109 --> 17:14.280
And give the others 50 strokes each!

17:14.400 --> 17:15.280
I'd like to see

17:15.550 --> 17:17.109
who dares spread rumors again

17:17.109 --> 17:19.310
about demons in this prefecture.

17:19.310 --> 17:20.400
My Lord! My Lord!

17:20.510 --> 17:22.589
My daughter may be reckless

17:22.589 --> 17:23.920
and deserving of death,

17:24.069 --> 17:24.880
but I beg you

17:25.310 --> 17:26.240
to spare her life.

17:26.240 --> 17:27.680
Take them away! Take them away!

17:27.680 --> 17:28.310
My Lord!

17:29.160 --> 17:30.210
Let me go!

17:31.270 --> 17:32.510
I've returned all the money.

17:32.510 --> 17:33.750
Why must you take my life?

17:33.750 --> 17:35.010
You corrupt official!

17:35.110 --> 17:36.110
You can't catch demons;

17:36.110 --> 17:37.590
all you know is killing people.

17:37.590 --> 17:38.310
And you!

17:38.640 --> 17:40.240
Demon Slayer of the Feiyu Guard?

17:40.240 --> 17:41.160
You use the name of demon hunting

17:41.160 --> 17:42.240
to bleed the people dry

17:42.240 --> 17:43.960
and collude with this corrupt official.

17:43.960 --> 17:44.450
And now

17:44.480 --> 17:46.880
you want to take our lives
to earn credit with your superiors.

17:46.880 --> 17:48.030
If I die, will that make the demons

17:48.030 --> 17:49.200
in this city disappear?

17:49.200 --> 17:50.400
Outrageous! Outrageous.

17:50.400 --> 17:51.790
Guards! Gag her

17:51.790 --> 17:53.000
and drag her out!

17:53.240 --> 17:54.570
-I'm telling...
-Wait.

17:59.960 --> 18:01.560
I think you made a good point.

18:03.880 --> 18:04.930
By killing,

18:05.550 --> 18:07.010
we can't catch any demons.

18:09.880 --> 18:11.310
But what if the one I kill

18:12.200 --> 18:13.350
is actually a demon?

18:22.750 --> 18:24.070
This is the compass

18:24.110 --> 18:26.370
the Feiyu Guard uses for hunting demons.

18:26.830 --> 18:27.790
When a demon is near,

18:27.790 --> 18:29.350
the bead inside moves

18:31.350 --> 18:32.550
and helps us

18:33.190 --> 18:34.870
locate it.

18:43.880 --> 18:46.270
From the city gate
to the magistrate's office,

18:46.270 --> 18:48.530
you've been spinning stories all night.

18:51.400 --> 18:53.880
Now honestly tell us your true identity.

19:07.960 --> 19:09.290
Since it's come to this,

19:09.400 --> 19:10.730
I'll tell you the truth.

19:11.240 --> 19:12.400
I am a demon.

19:12.920 --> 19:14.320
A nine-tailed fox demon.

19:14.550 --> 19:15.480
Go ahead, kill me,

19:15.480 --> 19:16.880
and go claim your credit.

19:17.720 --> 19:19.320
Since you're so eager to die,

19:20.480 --> 19:21.710
I'll grant your wish!

19:21.790 --> 19:22.310
My Lord!

19:22.440 --> 19:23.100
My Lord!

19:23.480 --> 19:24.280
Please don't!

19:24.480 --> 19:26.080
Let me explain on her behalf.

19:26.400 --> 19:27.550
My daughter

19:27.550 --> 19:29.400
is indeed different from others.

19:29.400 --> 19:31.330
Her blood carries a peculiar scent

19:31.510 --> 19:34.750
that attracts snakes, insects,
and other foul creatures.

19:34.750 --> 19:37.000
People may mistake her for a demon,

19:37.000 --> 19:38.250
but she isn't.

19:38.830 --> 19:41.630
Many people came to my home,
splashed dog's blood,

19:42.000 --> 19:45.750
drove us from place to place, and hunted
and reviled us wherever we went.

19:45.750 --> 19:47.070
But she's not a demon.

19:47.070 --> 19:49.220
She... she was born from my wife.

19:49.590 --> 19:50.320
She's human.

19:50.350 --> 19:51.000
Human!

19:51.350 --> 19:52.880
So her blood

19:53.640 --> 19:54.770
can attract demons?

19:56.590 --> 19:57.160
Wait...

20:01.240 --> 20:02.500
Since that's the case,

20:03.440 --> 20:06.230
I shall use you as bait
to lure out the true demons.

20:07.000 --> 20:08.530
Once we catch a great demon,

20:09.000 --> 20:10.260
I'll release them all.

20:14.270 --> 20:15.130
What do you say?

20:19.640 --> 20:20.840
You said it yourself.

20:21.030 --> 20:22.430
I hope you keep your word.

21:09.240 --> 21:10.440
Set up the formation!

22:02.030 --> 22:04.230
This is the heart of Qingyuan Mountain,

22:04.240 --> 22:06.970
a place filled with demonic energy
for 100 years.

22:08.030 --> 22:09.480
We read the stars and predicted

22:09.480 --> 22:11.610
that a great demon would appear today.

22:12.270 --> 22:14.530
We didn't expect you to suddenly show up.

22:17.000 --> 22:17.830
You...

22:17.830 --> 22:19.430
Don't pull me.

22:20.200 --> 22:20.720
You...

22:25.400 --> 22:26.080
Miss,

22:26.270 --> 22:27.470
I'm sorry about this.

22:28.200 --> 22:29.310
What are you doing?

22:30.440 --> 22:32.240
If what your father said is true,

22:32.720 --> 22:35.510
that the peculiar scent in your blood
can attract demons,

22:35.510 --> 22:37.840
then this will count as you making amends.

22:38.390 --> 22:39.960
I'll cooperate with you until dawn.

22:39.960 --> 22:40.590
Tomorrow at 5 in the morning,

22:40.590 --> 22:41.830
whether a great demon appears or not,

22:41.830 --> 22:43.310
you must let us go.

22:48.920 --> 22:49.720
It hurts.

22:52.530 --> 22:53.600
We'll see by then.

23:20.750 --> 23:21.460
My Lord,

23:21.920 --> 23:23.590
this girl only has a sharp tongue.

23:23.590 --> 23:24.750
Can we trust her?

23:24.960 --> 23:27.420
The compass reacts
when it gets close to her,

23:27.480 --> 23:29.720
which means she's not an ordinary person.

23:29.720 --> 23:32.200
But my demon-slaying blade didn't warn me,

23:33.350 --> 23:34.880
so she's not a demon.

23:35.310 --> 23:36.880
She's neither human nor a demon,

23:36.880 --> 23:38.940
so she must have some unusual traits.

23:39.240 --> 23:41.300
Today is the 15th day of the 7th month,

23:41.750 --> 23:44.480
when yin and yang shift
and demonic energy peaks.

23:58.680 --> 24:00.920
Xiao's wilderness survival rule No. 9:

24:00.920 --> 24:02.980
at night, always stay off the ground.

24:21.240 --> 24:22.750
Officials claim there are demons

24:22.750 --> 24:24.350
to embezzle money.

24:24.750 --> 24:26.000
Commoners claim there are demons

24:26.000 --> 24:27.880
just to scare their children.

24:28.310 --> 24:30.440
Great demons are not that easy to find.

25:24.510 --> 25:25.310
Be patient.

25:27.070 --> 25:29.010
This is no ordinary great demon.

25:33.110 --> 25:35.550
This time, I've truly found a treasure.

25:55.240 --> 25:56.440
You want this?

26:03.680 --> 26:04.160
You...

26:04.160 --> 26:05.000
Step back.

26:09.270 --> 26:10.000
Catch it.

26:23.070 --> 26:25.030
The Zhu Jiuyin lineage?

26:26.580 --> 26:27.270
Attack.

26:27.270 --> 26:27.830
Yes.

26:29.520 --> 26:30.880
I'll give it to you.

26:30.880 --> 26:31.590
Let's see

26:31.750 --> 26:32.950
who catches it first.

26:40.950 --> 26:42.390
[Seal]

27:05.240 --> 27:06.370
The great demon has appeared.

27:06.370 --> 27:07.700
You should let me go now.

27:07.990 --> 27:09.190
It's not time yet.

27:24.070 --> 27:25.480
Why did you try to kill it?

27:25.550 --> 27:27.950
Didn't you see
it was trying to kill people?

27:27.960 --> 27:29.310
It had no intention to kill people.

27:29.310 --> 27:30.750
If you hadn't
activated the formation first,

27:30.750 --> 27:32.030
it wouldn't have become so agitated.

27:32.030 --> 27:33.400
My Lord, please help us!

27:33.400 --> 27:35.000
We can't hold on much longer!

28:25.240 --> 28:25.920
Come back!

28:26.030 --> 28:26.960
It's dangerous!

28:28.640 --> 28:29.660
Catch her!

28:34.590 --> 28:35.640
Let me go!

28:35.640 --> 28:36.640
Your lord said

28:36.640 --> 28:38.480
he'd let me go once the demon appeared.

28:38.480 --> 28:40.080
How can he go back on his word?

28:40.640 --> 28:41.410
Miss!

28:55.270 --> 28:56.000
Ning'an!

28:56.210 --> 28:57.470
How dare you come back?

29:09.110 --> 29:10.240
You're not Ning'an.

29:12.420 --> 29:14.690
[Xiao Ming/Xiao Mu]

29:12.830 --> 29:15.360
Ning'an wouldn't
let herself smell this bad.

29:15.440 --> 29:17.430
You smell bad! Your mouth stinks.

29:19.920 --> 29:21.180
It's been 100 years.

29:21.510 --> 29:23.240
You still won't let go of His Lordship?

29:23.240 --> 29:23.880
What?

29:23.880 --> 29:25.340
Give me back His Lordship!

29:25.830 --> 29:26.950
Don't catch me!

29:56.240 --> 29:57.030
Don't run!

29:57.030 --> 29:58.490
Give me back His Lordship!

30:14.370 --> 30:16.280
Are you in a hurry to die?

30:16.510 --> 30:17.550
Come back here!

30:23.750 --> 30:24.750
Stop right there!

31:42.920 --> 31:43.720
She's a fallen immortal.

31:43.720 --> 31:44.510
Don't look at her!

31:44.510 --> 31:46.240
Don't fall for her charm spell!

32:32.960 --> 32:34.570
Monarch of All Demons?

32:35.480 --> 32:38.230
You have finally appeared.

32:48.070 --> 32:49.030
Ning'an.

32:52.200 --> 32:55.070
You still won't let me go.

34:33.030 --> 34:33.880
Hong Ye,

34:34.800 --> 34:36.880
soon I'll make you come to find me.

34:40.100 --> 34:41.350
Sir.

34:41.510 --> 34:43.239
According to the hexagrams...

34:48.150 --> 34:48.670
My Lord,

34:49.590 --> 34:51.230
so many of our brothers
were injured this time,

34:51.230 --> 34:52.840
but we still didn't catch the great demon.

34:52.840 --> 34:54.370
Could we use the Feiyu token

34:54.670 --> 34:57.190
to request more provincial troops
for reinforcement?

34:57.190 --> 34:59.710
Provincial troops
are fine for catching people.

34:59.710 --> 35:01.370
If we send them to hunt demons,

35:02.590 --> 35:04.850
they'll just be walking to their deaths.

35:06.280 --> 35:08.480
But that great demon is no ordinary one.

35:08.480 --> 35:10.340
If we don't eliminate it quickly,

35:10.440 --> 35:12.110
I'm afraid a disaster will happen.

35:12.110 --> 35:14.170
Great demons are hard to find anyway.

35:14.960 --> 35:16.480
Let's stop searching for now.

35:16.480 --> 35:18.140
Let's wait for it to come to us.

35:38.070 --> 35:38.760
My Lord!

35:43.710 --> 35:44.660
Thank goodness!

35:44.840 --> 35:46.190
My Lord, you have finally woken up!

35:46.190 --> 35:47.320
Heaven has shown mercy.

35:47.320 --> 35:48.960
I've been waiting for you day and night,

35:48.960 --> 35:50.470
and you're finally back!

35:50.670 --> 35:51.220
My Lord,

35:51.320 --> 35:52.920
please look at me carefully.

35:53.400 --> 35:54.550
Transform into Xiao Mu first.

35:54.550 --> 35:55.370
My Lord...

35:55.480 --> 35:56.410
I want to see him.

35:56.440 --> 35:57.840
My Lord, you...

35:58.070 --> 35:58.590
Three,

35:58.840 --> 35:59.280
two...

35:59.280 --> 36:00.360
Alright, alright.

36:13.150 --> 36:14.030
My Lord?

36:15.800 --> 36:16.510
Greetings,

36:17.670 --> 36:18.630
My Lord.

36:25.920 --> 36:27.800
It was that human girl

36:29.840 --> 36:31.360
who awakened me?

36:33.480 --> 36:34.230
Yes.

36:37.360 --> 36:38.190
Get away!

36:40.070 --> 36:41.590
Don't come over!

36:41.590 --> 36:42.440
It's bad enough you kidnapped me.

36:42.440 --> 36:43.700
Don't come any closer!

36:43.760 --> 36:44.920
I'll eat you!

36:45.400 --> 36:46.920
Stay back!

36:51.360 --> 36:52.190
Hello there.

36:52.760 --> 36:54.920
I was forced to come to Qingyuan Mountain.

36:54.920 --> 36:55.880
I meant no offense.

36:55.880 --> 36:57.760
Please let me go.

36:58.230 --> 36:59.300
Demons

37:00.670 --> 37:03.530
are a scourge
that all are duty-bound to eradicate.

37:05.950 --> 37:07.800
As the princess,

37:08.800 --> 37:10.230
my previous behavior

37:11.150 --> 37:13.880
was merely to disturb your mind.

37:17.050 --> 37:21.410
♪ In the cycle of reincarnation,
all beings are boundless and ordinary ♪

37:23.290 --> 37:27.730
♪ How can one judge demons
and specters by mere appearances? ♪

37:29.800 --> 37:34.420
♪ You forge your obsession
into vermilion around your fingers ♪

37:36.800 --> 37:41.180
♪ Crossing ten thousand years
to redeem me in the vast desolation ♪

37:43.760 --> 37:46.220
♪ All beings chase the seas of desire,
weaving nets of greed and hatred ♪

37:47.150 --> 37:49.640
♪ Only when suffering's carved into
steles do we realize it's karmic burden ♪

37:50.670 --> 37:55.690
♪ Only by burning the heart to ashes
can one end the vanity in karma ♪

37:57.590 --> 37:59.990
♪ When the world laughs at my obsession ♪

38:00.940 --> 38:03.500
♪ Only you can understand
my most fervent faith ♪

38:03.030 --> 38:03.800
Ning'an!

38:04.400 --> 38:08.060
♪ Let all beings bloom again,
breaking free from the shackles of fate ♪

38:04.800 --> 38:06.900
Only you can kill this demon!

38:07.150 --> 38:08.190
Take the sword!

38:08.230 --> 38:09.880
For the sake of all living beings,

38:09.050 --> 38:10.680
♪ In the end, it's not in vain ♪

38:09.880 --> 38:11.590
slay that demon immediately!

38:33.890 --> 38:37.880
♪ Burned to ashes,
the world vast and desolate ♪

38:44.550 --> 38:46.760
The greatest mistake of my life

38:49.760 --> 38:51.760
was meeting you.
